  "lookingFor": "Full-time design, creative direction or content roles in NYC or remote, plus freelance cover art, branding and campaign video.",
  "bio": [
    "I'm Yahya, a designer and creative director in New York, born and raised in Boston. I studied psychology and UX at Cornell, and I've worked where art, organizing and product meet ever since.",
    "That means art-directing covers for my music and other artists, producing campaign video for candidates, building fundraising creative at LaunchGood, and shipping product work as an analyst and project manager. Lunar Lighthouse, my studio, helps artists and mission-driven teams find their visual voice. I make work about faith, community and identity, for the people it's meant for."
  ],
